        "purpose": "SEND_CHAT_CHECKED (type 40): reads the owner does in the LINE app become a Matrix read receipt from the owner (upstream only bridged other people's reads, type 55). Photo groups (issue 187): LINE's own GID/GSEQ/GTOTAL metadata on a multi-photo send becomes org.wizard.line.album {id, index, count} on each image part, so Messenger shows one album. Sending photo groups (issue 188): an outgoing image marked org.wizard.line.album gets GID/GSEQ/GTOTAL, and is retried once without them if LINE refuses the group"
